  "question": {
    "text": "Among the following the correct statements are\nI. $\\mathrm{LiH}, \\mathrm{BeH}_2$ and $\\mathrm{MgH}_2$ are saline hydrides with significant covalent character\nII. Saline hydrides are volatile\nIII. Electron - precise hydrides are Lewis bases\nIV. The formula for chromium hydride is CrH",
    "image": null
  },
