  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Saline hydrides are not volatile as the strong ionic bonds keep the constituent ions together.\nThus, statement II is incorrect.\nElectron-precise hydrides like $\\mathrm{CH}_4, \\mathrm{SiH}_4$, act as pH - neutral species.\nThus, statement 3 is incorrect.",
